{"seq":2,"slug":"political-science","title":"政治学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"政治学-简介\">政治学 简介</h1><p>政治学研究权力的获取、分配与行使，以及由此构建的治理秩序和公共生活。从古典城邦的治国之道到当代全球治理的多层博弈，政治学帮助我们理解制度为何如此设计、政策如何产生、以及国家间合作与冲突的深层逻辑。</p>\n<p>本知识体系围绕理论、比较、国际和政策四个维度展开，引导自学者在抽象思辨与经验分析之间建立均衡的政治学素养。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>政治学理论</strong>追溯从柏拉图、亚里士多德到马基雅维利、霍布斯的经典政治思想，再延伸到当代权力分析与治理理论，帮助自学者掌握政治学的核心概念工具和思想源流。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>比较政治</strong>通过对不同政治体制的横向比较，讨论民主化的条件与路径、威权体制的运作逻辑以及政治制度对经济社会发展的影响，培养跨国比较的分析眼光。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>国际关系</strong>介绍现实主义、自由主义、建构主义三大理论范式，分析国际体系中的安全困境、合作机制和全球治理挑战，让自学者读懂国际新闻背后的理论图景。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>公共政策</strong>从政策分析的基本框架出发，考察政策议程的设定、方案的选择与执行，以及政策效果的评估方法，将政治学的抽象理论与公共管理的实际操作对接。</p>\n<p>建议自学者先从政治学理论获取概念基础，再通过比较政治和国际关系开阔视野，最后进入公共政策学习分析与评估工具。关注当前国内外政治动态并尝试用所学框架加以解读，是深化理解的有效路径。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"political-theory","title":"政治学理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/political-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-political-thought","title":"古典政治思想","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/political-theory/classical-political-thought"},{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-political-theory","title":"现代政治理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/political-theory/modern-political-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"power-and-governance","title":"权力与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/political-theory/power-and-governance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"comparative-politics","title":"比较政治","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/comparative-politics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"political-systems","title":"政治制度","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/comparative-politics/political-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"democratization","title":"民主化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/comparative-politics/democratization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"authoritarian-regimes","title":"威权政体","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/comparative-politics/authoritarian-regimes"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"international-relations","title":"国际关系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/international-relations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"realism-liberalism","title":"现实主义与自由主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/international-relations/realism-liberalism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"constructivism","title":"建构主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/international-relations/constructivism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-governance","title":"全球治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/international-relations/global-governance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"public-policy","title":"公共政策","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/public-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"policy-analysis","title":"政策分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/public-policy/policy-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-making-process","title":"政策制定过程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/public-policy/policy-making-process"},{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-evaluation","title":"政策评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/law/political-science/public-policy/policy-evaluation"}]}]}